# Copy to .dev.vars for local development.
# In production (deployed via Clawnify) these are injected automatically
# from your org's API keys / environment variables — see README.

# Required: send newsletters via Resend (https://resend.com/api-keys)
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── AI (generation + the assistant) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Any OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible endpoint works — a hosted API, a gateway,
# or a local server. AI_PROVIDER picks the *protocol* the endpoint speaks (not
# who hosts it), so one setting covers OpenAI, Anthropic, OpenRouter, Ollama,
# vLLM, LM Studio, Azure-style gateways and anything else that mimics either API.
#
#   AI_PROVIDER   "openai" (default) or "anthropic"
#   AI_BASE_URL   the endpoint; defaults per protocol
#   AI_API_KEY    the credential for that endpoint
#   AI_MODEL      the model id, e.g. gpt-4.1 / claude-sonnet-4-5
#
# Only AI_API_KEY is strictly required — the rest fall back to a sensible default.

# --- OpenAI (or anything speaking the OpenAI protocol) ---
AI_PROVIDER=openai
AI_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
AI_MODEL=gpt-4.1
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1     (default for AI_PROVIDER=openai)

# --- Anthropic (or anything speaking the Anthropic protocol) ---
# AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
# AI_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com/v1  (default for AI_PROVIDER=anthropic)

# --- OpenRouter ---
# AI_PROVIDER=openai
# AI_API_KEY=sk-or-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# AI_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4       (OpenRouter ids are namespaced)
# AI_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# --- Local (Ollama, LM Studio, vLLM, …) — most need no real key ---
# AI_PROVIDER=openai
# AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# AI_MODEL=llama3.1
# AI_API_KEY=ollama

# A trailing /v1 is added for a bare host, and a pasted full URL such as
# .../v1/chat/completions is trimmed back, so either form is fine.

# Older names, still honoured — checked only when their AI_* counterpart is
# unset, so an existing install keeps working without changes:
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# NEWSLETTER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4
